BraleModule_ReturnToPaymentRails
├── when the caller is not the owner
│   └── it should revert with OwnableUnauthorizedAccount
├── when the module balance is zero
│   └── it should revert with BraleModule_NothingToReturn
└── when the module holds a stray balance
    ├── it should send the full balance to the PaymentRails
    ├── it should emit TokensReturned
    ├── it should return the amount
    └── it should never send to the owner
